cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SHRF Corpus Monitor"
version: 0.7.0
date-released: "2026-05-09"
abstract: >
  A local monitoring and analysis application for the SHRF (Sympathetic Harmonic
  Resonance Framework) research corpus. Provides corpus validation, Zenodo uptake
  metrics tracking, provenance topology, resolution register, and export tools.
  Maintains strict separation between corpus provenance truth, audience behaviour
  metrics, and visual projection layers.
